<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Mukundara Hills Tiger Reserve outer boundary (2023 extent)</name><description>Outer boundary of Mukundara Hills Tiger Reserve as amended on 5 Oct 2023, reconstructed from Rajasthan Forest Department map files. Notified area 1,135.79 km². Measured 960.75 km² (WGS84). Not included because no public file draws them: the 2023 buffer part-blocks and compartments in Kota and Bundi, the National Chambal buffer piece, and 21 revenue villages near Rawatbhata (about 182 km² of the notified 1,135.79 km²). Village enclaves inside the Bhainsrorgarh sanctuary file are left open, as that file draws them. Reconstructed from Rajasthan Forest Department map files for reference. Not a legal or cadastral boundary: the reserve is defined by the schedules and boundary descriptions in the notifications. The Forest Department marks its files as for management use, not legal purposes. Built 2026-10-23 by mhtr.in; method and sources: https://mhtr.in/gis-maps/</description><Style id="outline"><LineStyle><color>ff1f5f2e</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>401f8a5c</color></PolyStyle></Style><Placemark><name>Mukundara Hills Tiger Reserve</name><description>Outer boundary of Mukundara Hills Tiger Reserve as amended on 5 Oct 2023, reconstructed from Rajasthan Forest Department map files. Notified area 1,135.79 km². Measured 960.75 km² (WGS84). Not included because no public file draws them: the 2023 buffer part-blocks and compartments in Kota and Bundi, the National Chambal buffer piece, and 21 revenue villages near Rawatbhata (about 182 km² of the notified 1,135.79 km²). Village enclaves inside the Bhainsrorgarh sanctuary file are left open, as that file draws them. Reconstructed from Rajasthan Forest Department map files for reference. Not a legal or cadastral boundary: the reserve is defined by the schedules and boundary descriptions in the notifications. The Forest Department marks its files as for management use, not legal purposes. Built 2026-10-23 by mhtr.in; method and sources: https://mhtr.in/gis-maps/</description><styleUrl>#outline</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="layer"><value>outer-boundary</value></Data><Data name="name"><value>Reserve outer boundary (2023 extent, as far as public files draw it)</value></Data><Data name="measured_area_km2_wgs84"><value>960.75</value></Data><Data name="notified_area_km2"><value>1135.787</value></Data><Data name="reliability"><value>Official files joined; about 182 km² of the notified reserve has no public map and is not included.</value></Data><Data name="method"><value>Union of the Forest Department's reserve file (2013 extent), its national park and sanctuary files, the Bhainsrorgarh WLS file and the whole 2023 buffer blocks drawn in the Kota district file. Holes under 0.01 km² that only appear where two files' edges miss each other are filled.</value></Data><Data name="instrument"><value>Rajasthan Forest Department notification F.3(8)Forest/2012, 9 Apr 2013; Rajasthan Forest Department notification F.3(22)Forest/2023, 5 Oct 2023</value></Data><Data name="source_files"><value>Forest Department file 'Mukundara Tiger Reserve.kmz' (Tiger Reserve boundary); listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2025-02-24; SHA-256 ec3c6d02c14a… | Forest Department file 'Mukundara Hills National Park.kmz'; listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 a23ca5b24f00… | Forest Department file 'Darrah Wildlife Sanctuary.kmz'; listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 cf25d680f872… | Forest Department file 'Jawahar Sagar Wildlife Sanctuary.kmz'; listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 ab6e078d52aa… | Forest Department file 'Bhensrodgarh Wildlife Sanctuary.kmz'; listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 b670cf408245… | Forest Department file 'KOTA.kmz' (Kota district forest blocks); listed as on 31.07.2018; server copy 2018-08-07; SHA-256 f27d048338dc…</value></Data><Data name="source_urls"><value>https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/tigerreserve/Mukundara%20Tiger%20Reserve.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/wildlife/Mukundara%20Hills%20National%20Park.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/wildlife/Darrah%20Wildlife%20Sanctuary.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/wildlife/Jawahar%20Sagar%20Wildlife%20Sanctuary.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/wildlife/Bhensrodgarh%20Wildlife%20Sanctuary.kmz | https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Forest%20Development/Districtwise%20Forest%20Blocks%20a%20Google%20Earth/update/kota/KOTA.kmz</value></Data><Data name="built"><value>2026-10-23</value></Data><Data name="disclaimer"><value>Reconstructed from Rajasthan Forest Department map files for reference. Not a legal or cadastral boundary: the reserve is defined by the schedules and boundary descriptions in the notifications. The Forest Department marks its files as for management use, not legal purposes.</value></Data><Data name="gaps"><value>Not included because no public file draws them: the 2023 buffer part-blocks and compartments in Kota and Bundi, the National Chambal buffer piece, and 21 revenue villages near Rawatbhata (about 182 km² of the notified 1,135.79 km²). Village enclaves inside the Bhainsrorgarh sanctuary fil